{"id":"ab17d8279fb221aa","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-ax-hilbert-impl1.md","title":"Hilbert Axiom Schema 1 (Implication)","display":"ax-hilbert-impl1 — Hilbert Axiom Schema 1 (Implication)","type":"axiom","metadata":{"type":"axiom","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-ax-hilbert-impl1","aliases":["58-ax-hilbert-impl1"],"display":"ax-hilbert-impl1 — Hilbert Axiom Schema 1 (Implication)","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"axiom"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-ax-hilbert-impl1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-ax-hilbert-impl1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ax-hilbert-impl1 — Hilbert Axiom Schema 1 (Implication)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> (signature)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\)</span> (formulas, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HilbertImpl1Axiom}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{HilbertImpl1Axiom}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (axiom-instance predicate defined here)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对公式码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\to\\psi\\coloneqq\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi\">\\(\\varphi\\to\\psi\\coloneqq\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi\\)</span>；右端是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"65418b505fc53093\" href=\"?note=65418b505fc53093\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-formula.md\">../batch17/58-df-formula.md</a> 的语法构造，不是元语言真值蕴涵。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}impl1} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertImpl1Axiom}_S(\\theta,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\theta=(\\varphi\\to(\\psi\\to\\varphi))\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}impl1} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertImpl1Axiom}_S(\\theta,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\theta=(\\varphi\\to(\\psi\\to\\varphi))\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The predicate classifies the formula instances of the first Hilbert implication schema; it does not confuse object-language implication with a metatheoretic universal assertion.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)$ (formulas, see [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-formula.md","status":"resolved","id":"65418b505fc53093","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"对公式码 $\\varphi,\\psi$，$\\varphi\\to\\psi\\coloneqq\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi$；右端是 [[../batch17/58-df-formula.md]] 的语法构造，不是元语言真值蕴涵。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\theta,\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{HilbertImpl1Axiom}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi,\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\to\\psi\\coloneqq\\neg\\varphi\\lor\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ax\\text{-}hilbert\\text{-}impl1} \\vdash \\mathrm{HilbertImpl1Axiom}_S(\\theta,\\Sigma)\\leftrightarrow \\exists\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\Sigma)\\;\\bigl(\\theta=(\\varphi\\to(\\psi\\to\\varphi))\\bigr)","display":true}],"bytes":1109,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-13","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-ax-hilbert-impl1.md|58-ax-hilbert-impl1]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["65418b505fc53093"]}